{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "cda4a98b9ec33aabe61c7a535c5506e29c1b06797054c594e0be1141274e2b91", "ja": "突然ですが、{$P$}さんに\nクイズなのです！", "zh": "那么马上，\n茉莉要出谜题给{$P$}先生的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "8bf8716694d69ecb17ed2214cab7f3024b364a23dd620d47b4e6b0ec2304f1aa", "ja": "ずばり！　姫になるために必要なものとは、\nいったいなんでしょー？", "zh": "问题就是！成为公主所需要的东西，\n到底是什么呢──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f98e7d5892a2f2e6dcfbd6a6f29ba944d5bcacf015b2eff87eee3a6b9fa6f5a1", "ja": "クイズ？　って、どうしたんだ突然……。", "zh": "谜题？怎么突然出谜题啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "afd35e6caf6e0d1cd6ec3e1329848371e16672f83f725af3afebbf451ce9961d", "ja": "いいから答えるのです、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "别管了，快点回答喔，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "7b6a325e5fa9e757a5390e5754160887d184212952767c6a39345c828af89e63", "ja": "これは姫をプロデュースする上で、\n避けては通れないことなのですよ？", "zh": "这可是培育公主时不能逃避的问题唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1005_p", "source_sha256": "79f051a66a31e7fc5f7b89a1f6dd9d7c0469391f6e63c9035da3088b9fd33924", "ja": "それは重要だな！　……姫になるためには、か。\nうーん、なんだろうなぁ。気品とか、マナーとか……？", "zh": "这确实是重要的问题！……成为公主所需要的？\n唔──会是什么呢？气质或是礼仪之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "95ab3afd863ad6807972e1e39b9558491fa4f3d5426e48ca5774377202f5faf9", "ja": "気品やマナーも大事ですけど、それは後から\nいくらでも身につけられるものなのです。", "zh": "气质跟礼仪虽然也很重要，\n但都是可以后天培养起来的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "e9e1af89db24c12739866eab82213003a875f0c049a3b3cee20af2de6795edbb", "ja": "大事なことは、その前にあるのです！", "zh": "重要的是更基本的东西喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1b278eb3eda74a83977c629c7624aa245a1d5508617271bd77b6b086e50191d4", "ja": "その前か……あ、心構えとか？", "zh": "更基本的吗……啊，比如心态吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "58ff410d953f4544e106fe8089759f00e448445f532c58b2424ea24936d024d0", "ja": "ピンポーン！なのですー！\nさすが、{$P$}さんなのです！", "zh": "叮咚──！答对了唷──！\n不愧是{$P$}先生的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "43a209d53396c9ece69dd7fd527407c0ec294544ccd3a78d00a5b95003c92e56", "ja": "まつりは、みんなの姫なのです。\nそれを間違えなければ、姫は姫らしくいられるのです♪", "zh": "茉莉是大家的公主唷。\n只要别搞错这一点，公主就能维持公主该有的样子唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "08d30a31f319133494af514201245cfcbb6295ef216736690c47d73b7d0fc477", "ja": "つまりびゅーてぃほー！な姫になるには、\nびゅーてぃほー！な心構えが、必要なのです～。", "zh": "也就是说，想要成为美丽的公主，\n就必须保持美丽的心态喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "053152e529b2eb947b204bc3228d957b12fb4c377358592c2a4145978b5a1137", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、一理あるような……。\nけど、どうして急にそんな話を？", "zh": "原来如此。你说得对，好像是有点道理……\n但你怎么突然提起这种事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "e5a6cf124aeeea029d90a243bf4f62ce76ff28e1880507feccdb6464e84d4ff3", "ja": "今回の衣装は、普段のふわふわできゅーと！な\n姫と、ちょっぴり違うのです。妖精さんなのです。", "zh": "这次的服装跟平常软绵绵又可爱的公主有一点不同，\n是妖精的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "dc5f069995dde1ec2cd97d7d282a4c5786179259e415d18cecf8303af8d479ac", "ja": "でも、どんな衣装を着ても、まつりはまつり。\nお姫様には、変わりないのです。", "zh": "但是，不管穿着怎样的服装，茉莉就是茉莉。\n茉莉依然是公主的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "b21e4e5b9205e17aa7fc23b178d69d940382f2a8e9c256fdd95fbe35c8927a96", "ja": "ね？　{$P$}さん。\n……ね？", "zh": "呐？{$P$}先生。\n……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0e90b3f0871897402838d3d6a4a440e7d5841b544e70bd8e19f4116552d676ac", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……そういう事か。\n大丈夫、ちゃんと似合ってるよ。", "zh": "哦，我懂了……原来是这样。\n放心，这套服装真的很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c596f91ed842859117a4192ad7c82cb68c3c6f1ae458caf72062a8e9ca37ac78", "ja": "今回の衣装は、清楚なイメージだから。より一層、\nお姫様らしく見えるようになったんじゃないか？", "zh": "这次的服装是清纯风格，\n应该会让你看起来更像公主吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "633efa9ea664d347299de0c716d32af439d0863ca00e856fc1dd81321a13d7d0", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さん？\nそういうことだけど、そういうことじゃないのです。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生。\n你说得没错，但茉莉不是这个意思的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "9f5061fc696906c6196c7910b50d4637664653e190633012cd3467e5645ac2c6", "ja": "でも、新しい衣装を「似合う」って言ってくれたのは\nうれしいので、不問にしてあげるのです。", "zh": "不过，你说新服装「很适合茉莉」让茉莉很高兴，\n所以就不跟你追究了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1020_p", "source_sha256": "54dbe6b2118b613463e82c2573cc832690f05eb3864516d7ec17ba22990f39cd", "ja": "そ、そうか。ありがとう……？", "zh": "是、是吗？谢谢你……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "5ea57d53516aff3dfd5d7b9a414625bfc7a54f0cd563cd2b29e8a162c0fa27aa", "ja": "どういたしまして、なのです。姫は新しい衣装で、\nたくさんお仕事がしたいのです♪", "zh": "不客气的唷。\n公主想要多多穿上这套新服装工作♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0114_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d69caa7ffe805d068eb45339b1291c72265f765b4a86ae07ebd3f39972ff6718", "ja": "（それから、まつりは何度も衣装をチェックしていた。\n……その希望は、叶えてあげないとな！）", "zh": "（之后茉莉检查了服装好几遍。\n……我得实现这份心愿才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
